 11359	      mcp__codex__codex-reply).
 11360	    - family_ids: sorted unique pattern family identifiers that
 11361	      matched (subset of {"harness_mimicry", "xml_system_tag",
 11362	      "tool_use_forgery"}).
 11363	    - match_count: total match count across all families.
 11364	    - first_offset_bucket: coarse-bucketed first match offset
 11365	      ("0-100" / "100-1k" / "1k-10k" / "10k-100k" / "100k+") — raw
 11366	      offset is FORBIDDEN per LLM06 side-channel guard.
