   101	    ADR-001 S318) so the salt sits next to the audit log it protects —
   102	    per project, no longer per ``$HOME``. Still avoids importing
   103	    ``audit_emit`` at module load to stay loadable from any hook
   104	    (including hooks that emit no audit events).
   105	
   106	    rail r13 P1-5 — FAMILY-ATOMICITY: quando os overrides movem a
   107	    familia (`CEO_AUDIT_LOG_PATH` / `CEO_AUDIT_LOG_DIR`), o `.salt`
   108	    acompanha. Deixa-lo em `runtime_state_dir()` enquanto log, key, lock
   109	    e errors se mudam contradiz o invariante do ADR-001 S318 item 3 (e a
   110	    claim do CLAUDE.md §5), e faria custodia/backup do dir efetivo
   111	    PERDEREM o salt. Mesma cascata de `audit_hmac._audit_dir_from_env`.
