   352	                    # target. Open with O_NOFOLLOW (refuse a symlinked final
   353	                    # component) | O_DIRECTORY (refuse a non-dir), then fchmod +
   354	                    # fstat the FD — no path re-resolution, so no race window.
   355	                    fd = os.open(
   356	                        str(d), os.O_RDONLY | os.O_NOFOLLOW | os.O_DIRECTORY
